WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Having the ball does not mean you must throw it.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
First ask: is there a realistic chance to get an out?

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
If the runner is already safe, a late throw may only add risk.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Secure the ball, watch the runners, and stay ready for another play.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Holding the ball does not automatically make it dead. Follow your rules.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Make the next smart decision. Take a real out, or hold it.
